      "mergeID": "6793be9bd68b5966de7b365b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I would like to report an issue regarding the use of wireless headphones, specifically the AirPods Pro 2, with the iPhone 16.\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\n-When the device experiences game lag or spikes in GPU or CPU load, the audio becomes distorted.\n\n-This distortion requires the user to reconnect the headphones to restore normal audio functionality.\n\n-Notably, this issue does not occur when no Bluetooth headphones are connected to the device.\n\nDevice Specifications:\n\nModel: iPhone 16\n\nStorage: 256GB\n\nRAM: 8GB",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Audio Issues with Wireless Headphones on iPhone",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "66bc9e9d43ee5521998a762e",
